messages "donations (Profezzorn, Feb 13):**Nanny mud is up again, but donations are still welcome, we are aimingto get a whole new machine for Nannymud. To donate money, place anamount of your own choise in the Swedish Postal Giro Account 42 9200-9, (which is the account for 'Harrys Vdnner' or 'Harry's friends')and note that the money is for Nanny. Doing this might cost more moneyif you live outside of Scandinavia, so if you would like to pool yourmoney with some local people and send it all at once it may be morecost effective. Players who give money for this noble cause will notreceive questpoints, experience points, gold coins or any other formof advantages in the mud. But we will certainly make other attempts tothank them.	/Fredrik Hubinette (aka Profezzorn, recently elected Game Master)**wedding shop (Akasha, Feb 17):**well, u may have or may have not noticed a change in thewedding shop :) Hopefully there are no more typos andits easier to buy things in the shop (hint: u can evenhave Monique 'describe' the items BEFORE u spend thedough!) also i should hope the items themselves rntbuggy (recoded those too ;) let me know how it goes!and yes next is the bonsai quest (dont ask me about it!i will post more details when i am done with it!)        /Akasha mutters about reading Prof's code *grin*PS oh yes...i forgot to mention... i changed thelocket too (hope u like the changes!)**"
num_messages 2
